sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Child
    participant App as Flutter App
    participant Cache as Firestore Cache and Local Store
    participant Queue as Sync Queue
    participant API as Callable Cloud Functions
    participant DB as Cloud Firestore

    Child->>App: Start or resume a cached activity
    App->>Cache: Read activity, session and last known server version
    Cache-->>App: Cached playable state

    Note over App,API: Connection becomes unavailable

    Child->>App: Submit response while offline
    App->>Cache: Save response locally
    App->>Queue: Enqueue event with idempotency key and base version
    Queue-->>App: Pending event recorded
    App-->>Child: Show saved-offline status

    loop Additional offline responses
        Child->>App: Continue permitted offline activity
        App->>Cache: Persist response and progress
        App->>Queue: Append ordered pending event
    end

    Note over App,API: Connection is restored
    App->>Queue: Start synchronization

    loop Oldest pending event first
        Queue->>API: Send event with idempotency key and base version
        API->>DB: Verify identity, ownership and session state

        alt Duplicate event already accepted
            DB-->>API: Existing authoritative result
            API-->>Queue: Success with existing result
            Queue->>Cache: Apply result and remove event
        else Server state matches base version
            API->>DB: Validate and commit with a Firestore transaction
            DB-->>API: Updated session state and version
            API-->>Queue: Accepted authoritative result
            Queue->>Cache: Apply result and remove event
        else Server state changed
            DB-->>API: Current authoritative state
            API-->>Queue: Conflict with recovery instructions
            Queue->>Cache: Preserve local event and apply server state
            Cache-->>App: Conflict requires reconciliation
            App-->>Child: Explain changed activity state
            App->>API: Retry compatible event or discard invalid event
        else Authentication expired
            API-->>Queue: Reauthentication required
            Queue-->>App: Pause synchronization
            App-->>Child: Ask parent to sign in again
        end
    end

    Queue-->>App: Synchronization complete
    App->>Cache: Mark session fully synchronized
    App-->>Child: Remove offline indicator
